   "widgets_values": [
    "AusBoss node tour \u2014 every wire is the point.\n\n1) Pick any video in Load Video (this graph needs no models).\n2) Queue. The clip is thinned, split and rejoined, padded to a 512 square with the pad bars masked, de-flickered against its first frame everywhere except those bars, retimed back to double rate, and saved \u2014 with the fps, frame budget, filename, and CRF all arriving over wires from Math, Image Size, Text, and Integer nodes.\n3) Read the saved path in Show Text; flick first vs last frame in the A/B panel."
   ]
  }
